zmail proton-harness: serve go-proton-api's fake API on a fixed port with a
caller-supplied certificate. Applied by docker/proton-harness/Dockerfile (and
by scripts/proton-harness.sh in native mode) on top of the pinned
go-proton-api commit; see docker/proton-harness/README.md for why.

